OL,3,GNEWSACommuters face delays after crash
OL,4,Acloses M6
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said the southbound carriageway was
OL,7,Fopened just before 08:00 but northbound
OL,8,Fwas still closed. Diversions have been
OL,9,Fput in place.
